# CLAUDE_LOCAL.md — Personal AI Instructions (NOT checked in)

> Copy this file to `CLAUDE_LOCAL.md` in the repo root and fill it in with your
> personal preferences. `CLAUDE_LOCAL.md` is ignored by git (see `.gitignore`),
> so nothing you put here will leak to other contributors.
>
> Claude Code automatically reads `CLAUDE.md` (team-wide) **and** `CLAUDE_LOCAL.md`
> (your personal overrides) on every session start. Put anything that is specific
> to **your** machine, **your** workflow, or **your** current focus here — not in
> the shared `CLAUDE.md`.

